Scoped Limitless Audio Format demuxer

The probe, header fields, quality-to-codec table, channel-position layout
chain, rate limits and stored-bitmask block framing in src/laf.ts follow
libavformat/lafdec.c (laf_probe, laf_read_header, laf_read_packet,
laf_read_seek), for files with exactly one stream.
